        "$id": "8"
      },
      {
        "statement": {
          "_text": "I do know of an interesting spell that I could pass down. It’s quite helpful in this ghost-filled region. The Mist Boon. It will protect you from ghostly, ethereal attacks, and make your own ethereal damage more powerful. How does 50 silvers in exchange sound?",
